<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan to auction T$15 bln T-bills on Oct 15.</title>
<headline>Taiwan to auction T$15 bln T-bills on Oct 15.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's finance ministry said in a statement on Wednesday that the central bank will auction T$15 billion in 182-day treasury bills on its behalf on October 15.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
